    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0368" n="110" xml:id="pg110"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1460</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Van Dyke</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-17T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 17, 1915, 6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>104. Your 151, February 16, 7 p. m.</p>
                <p>If situation should arise as stated the Netherlands may count on sympathetic
                    attitude of the United States. Do not understand what moral support means.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
